# ==========================================
# Large Model Weights / Checkpoints (>50MB)
# Note: GitHub warns on >50MB and rejects >100MB.
# Host weights on HuggingFace / GitHub Releases or use Git LFS.
# ==========================================
*.pth
*.pt
*.bin
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pkl
*.joblib
!backend/models/.gitkeep

